        "field": "payload",
        "fieldType": "msg",
        "format": "html",
        "syntax": "mustache",
        "template": "<mjml>\n  <mj-head>\n    <mj-title>Hello world</mj-title>\n    <mj-font name=\"Roboto\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300,500\"></mj-font>\n    <mj-attributes>\n      <mj-all font-family=\"Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif\"></mj-all>\n      <mj-text font-weight=\"300\" font-size=\"16px\" color=\"#616161\" line-height=\"24px\"></mj-text>\n      <mj-section padding=\"0px\"></mj-section>\n    </mj-attributes>\n  </mj-head>\n  <mj-body background-color=\"#f0f0f0\">\n    <mj-section padding=\"30px 0\" background-color=\"#ffffff\" padding=\"20px\">\n      <mj-column width=\"60%\">\n        <mj-text font-size=\"10px\">Dikirim otomatis dari aplikasi IMS, Mohon tidak di replay</mj-text>\n      </mj-column>\n      <mj-column width=\"40%\">\n        <mj-text font-size=\"18px\" font-weight=\"1000\" align=\"right\">IMS</mj-text>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n    <mj-section background-color=\"#ffffff\">\n      <mj-column width=\"45%\">\n        <mj-text align=\"center\" font-weight=\"500\" padding=\"0px\" font-size=\"18px\">{{payload.subject}}</mj-text>\n        <mj-divider border-width=\"2px\" border-color=\"#616161\"></mj-divider>\n        <mj-divider border-width=\"2px\" border-color=\"#616161\" width=\"45%\"></mj-divider>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n    <mj-section background-color=\"#ffffff\">\n      <mj-column>\n        <mj-text>\n          Yth. Bapak/Ibu {{payload.template.data.full_name_to}},\n        </mj-text>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n    <mj-section background-color=\"#ffffff\">\n      <mj-column>\n        <mj-text>\n          Kami ingin menginformasikan bahwa Anda telah menerima permintaan persetujuan terkait dokumen yang diajukan\n          oleh.\n        </mj-text>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n    <mj-section background-color=\"#ffffff\">\n      <mj-column>\n        <mj-text>\n          <b>Nama: {{payload.template.data.full_name}}.</b>\n          <br />\n          <b>Email: {{payload.template.data.email}}.</b>\n        </mj-text>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n    <mj-section background-color=\"#ffffff\">\n      <mj-column>\n        <mj-text>\n          Mohon kesediaan Anda untuk meninjau dokumen tersebut melalui tautan di bawah ini\n        </mj-text>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n    <mj-section background-color=\"#ffffff\">\n      <mj-column>\n        <mj-button href=\"{{payload.template.data.url}}\" background-color=\"#2186d8\" color=\"white\" font-size=\"16px\"\n          padding=\"25px 25px\" border-radius=\"5px\" align=\"center\">\n          Review dokumen\n        </mj-button>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n    <mj-section background-color=\"#2186d8\">\n      <mj-column width=\"89%\">\n        <mj-text padding=\"40px 0px\">\n          <p style=\"font-style: italic; color:#ffffff; line-height: 9px\"> Salam hormat,\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"font-style: italic; color:#ffffff; line-height: 9px\">Aplikasi IMS</p>\n        </mj-text>\n      </mj-column>\n    </mj-section>\n  </mj-body>\n</mjml>",
